@startuml
skinparam maxMessageSize 150
actor User
participant "UI Layer\n(InboxView)" as UI
participant "Logic Layer\n(MessageService)" as Logic
database "Database\n(MongoDB)" as DB

User -> UI : 1. Navigate to Inbox
activate UI
UI -> Logic : 2. getMyInbox(Username)
activate Logic
Logic -> DB : 3. Query: findMessagesByReceiver
activate DB
DB --> Logic : 4. Return List of Messages
deactivate DB
Logic --> UI : 5. Return Messages Data
deactivate Logic
UI --> User : 6. Display Messages in Grid

User -> UI : 7. Click "Show Media" (MediaPreviewButton)
UI -> Logic : 8. getFileById(FileID) (Async Thread)
activate Logic
Logic -> DB : 9. Fetch Binary File Data
activate DB
DB --> Logic : 10. Return Binary Data
deactivate DB
Logic --> UI : 11. Return File
deactivate Logic
UI --> User : 12. Open Media Player Dialog
deactivate UI
@enduml